    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN406 · Chapter 6 · Session 16</span>\n<h2>Session 16 — Chapter 7 (continued)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13802 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN406 · Chương 6 · Buổi 16</span>\n<h2>Buổi 16 — Chapter 7 (continued)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13802 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 7 (continued)<br><br>7.4. What went wrong?<br><br>7.5. Lessons from the Crisis</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>- Textbook Chapter 7<br><br>- Slide Chapter 7<br><br>- Other Journals (The Economist, The Financial Times, The Risk Magazine if available)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Read Textbook Chapter 7<br><br>- Read Slide Chapter 7<br><br>- Read other journals (The Economist, The Financial Times, The Risk Magazine if available).</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HN1</strong> — Why did mortgage lenders frequently not check on information in the mortgage application during the 2000 to 2007 period?</li>\n<li><strong>HN2</strong> — Why do you think the increase in house prices during the 2000 to 2007 period is referred to as a bubble?</li>\n<li><strong>HN3</strong> — What is a waterfall in a securitization?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
