    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN406 · Assessment 4/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13802 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN406 · Đầu điểm 4/6</span>\n<h2>Individual Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13802 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">2-3 weeks</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">_ Quantitative questions require students to collect data and perform detailed analyses in excel format with formulas.<br><br>_ Qualitative and discussion questions require students to provide their own assessment and judgement with detailed explanation in their answers.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Number of questions will depend on the lengths and difficulty levels of each question given by the lecturer.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Part 1,2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Take-Home</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">_ Students must submit their individual reports in time (on or before the given deadline).If students submit late without a legit reason, then students will receive a grade 0 for the assignment.<br><br>_ Students' individual reports will not exceed 10 pages in length (1,500 to 2,000 words, typed, double-spaced, excluding Works Cited page).<br><br>_ Any proof of plagarism will result in grade 0 for the assignment.<br><br>_ Individual assignment grade will be given based on the quality of the report with regard to the correctness and clarity of the calculations, answers and explantion.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 20 — Individual Assignment Handout</li><li>Session 29 — Group assignment handout</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 20 — Individual Assignment Handout</li><li>Buổi 29 — Group assignment handout</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
